    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "Once upon a time, the Great Seven had ruled over their own lands in Twisted-Wonderland, a world of magic and wonder. Their illustrious deeds were so legendary that the prestigious magic school Night Raven College, modeled its seven dorms after them: Queen of Hearts, the King of Beasts, the Sea Witch, the Sorcerer of the Sands, the Fairest Queen, the King of the Underworld, and the Thorn Fairy. However, high school student Yuken (Yu) never knew this world existed until he is suddenly transported into the middle of Night Raven College's entrance ceremony. Now, he must face monsters, whimsical magicians-in-training, and mysterious incidents, all without any magic of his own. Will Yu ever find a way back to his own world?",
        "jpn": "物語は、魔法の鏡を介して、別の世界への主人公の呼び出しから始まります。 そこで、主人公は魔法のアカデミー「ナイトレイヴンズカレッジ」を発見し、彼の保護を提供する仮面の男である後者の謎のディレクターに会います。 彼の世界に戻る方法を探して、プレーヤーは学校の他の学生を知ることから始めなければなりません..."
    },
